{"id":"7127f6bc34b9efe3","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Possible Cofinality Generator","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator — ZFC Pcf3 Possible Cofinality Generator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator — ZFC Pcf3 Possible Cofinality Generator","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator — ZFC Pcf3 Possible Cofinality Generator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"434af3b8c053a816\" href=\"?note=434af3b8c053a816\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f7fe6d0b50ba7f69\" href=\"?note=f7fe6d0b50ba7f69\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\lambda,B\\in V\">\\(A,\\lambda,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\)</span> are imported above</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{&lt;\\lambda}[A]\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq A:\\exists S\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(C,S)\\land\\forall\\mu\\in S\\;(\\mu&lt;\\lambda))\\}\">\\(J_{&lt;\\lambda}[A]\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq A:\\exists S\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(C,S)\\land\\forall\\mu\\in S\\;(\\mu&lt;\\lambda))\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\leq\\lambda}[A]\\coloneqq J_{&lt;\\lambda^+}[A]\">\\(J_{\\leq\\lambda}[A]\\coloneqq J_{&lt;\\lambda^+}[A]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PossibleCofinalityGenerator}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PossibleCofinalityGenerator}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}possible\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}generator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PossibleCofinalityGenerator}_S(A,\\lambda,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land B\\subseteq A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\\land\\lambda\\in S\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land J_{\\leq\\lambda}[A]\n=\\{C\\cup D:C\\in J_{&lt;\\lambda}[A]\\land D\\subseteq B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}possible\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}generator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PossibleCofinalityGenerator}_S(A,\\lambda,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land B\\subseteq A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\\land\\lambda\\in S\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land J_{\\leq\\lambda}[A]\n=\\{C\\cup D:C\\in J_{&lt;\\lambda}[A]\\land D\\subseteq B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"434af3b8c053a816","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md","status":"resolved","id":"f7fe6d0b50ba7f69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\lambda,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"J_{<\\lambda}[A]\\coloneqq\\{C\\subseteq A:\\exists S\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(C,S)\\land\\forall\\mu\\in S\\;(\\mu<\\lambda))\\}","display":false},{"tex":"J_{\\leq\\lambda}[A]\\coloneqq J_{<\\lambda^+}[A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PossibleCofinalityGenerator}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}possible\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}generator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PossibleCofinalityGenerator}_S(A,\\lambda,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land B\\subseteq A\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\\land\\lambda\\in S\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land J_{\\leq\\lambda}[A]\n=\\{C\\cup D:C\\in J_{<\\lambda}[A]\\land D\\subseteq B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"d4482f7b67f48709","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PossibleCofinalityGenerator}_S$ (canonical generator predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3070","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator.md|58-df-zfc-pcf3-possible-cofinality-generator]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","434af3b8c053a816","f7fe6d0b50ba7f69"]}